  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1330",
    "issue_date": "2026-08-28T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:05:51.710Z",
    "meteorologist": "Binu Maharjan",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको प्रभाव रहेको छ। हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा पश्चिममा सरदर स्थान भन्दा केही उत्तर तथा पूर्वमा सरदर स्थानको आसपास रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, the entire country is under the influence of monsoon winds. The monsoon trough is currently located slightly north of its normal position in the west and around its normal position in the east.",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका धेरै स्थान, र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थान तथा  कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ ।  मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail throughout the country. There is a possibility of moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning at many places in the mountainous and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, at some places in the mountainous and hilly areas of Lumbini Province, and at a few places in the mountainous and hilly areas of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is a possibility of moderate rain with thunder and lightning at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, and at a few places in the Terai areas of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places in the mountainous and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा, तथा मधेश प्रदेश साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग, कर्णाली प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भाग  तथा लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको पहाडी र तराई भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ |",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail throughout the country. There is a possibility of moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning at many places in the mountainous and hilly areas of the country. There is a possibility of moderate rain with thunder and lightning at many places in the Terai areas of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai area of Koshi Province. There is a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places in the mountainous and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, the hilly area of Karnali Province, and the hilly and Terai areas of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
